{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_delete_own_only", "label": "delete removes own properties only", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Does not free memory, remove variables, or touch the prototype. Deleting an own key unshadows the inherited one."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_delete_return_value", "label": "delete return value", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "true does not mean anything was deleted. false (or TypeError in strict) only reports an own non-configurable property."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_delete_array_hole", "label": "delete on an array leaves a hole", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "length is unchanged. Use splice, filter, or toSpliced. Holes make array methods inconsistent and slower."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_v8_hiddenclass", "label": "V8 HiddenClass", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Objects sharing a shape share a HiddenClass so inline caches stay fast. Frequent add/delete generates HiddenClass and descriptor-array overhead."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_dictionary_mode", "label": "V8 dictionary mode", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slow mode: properties in a hash table, no descriptor array, inline caches do not work. One delete is not documented to trigger it."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_rest_omit_key", "label": "Rest destructuring to omit a key", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "const { password, ...safe } = user builds a new stable-shape object. Shallow; nested copies survive."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_delete_and_its_cost_map_for_dynamic_keys", "label": "Map for dynamic keys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/delete-and-its-cost.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "map.delete is first-class, no HiddenClass cost, any key type. If you delete in a loop you wanted a Map."}